      "q": "8. What is the ecological principle behind the biological control method of managing pest insects?",
      "a": "Variable biological control methods are based on a concept known as predation. In predation, the predator feeds on the prey. Hence, predators regulate the population of prey in a habitat, helping in the control of pest insects."
