      "q": "7.\n\nCBSE Class 12 Biology Syllabus\n\nStartFragment\nEndFragment\n\nConclusion \nThe Ecosystem chapter teaches us about the way different living things in our world connect and depend on each other. It looks at the parts of ecosystems, how energy moves through them, and how new life takes over from old life. We also learn how things like carbon and water move around the planet, and how we can affect these processes. The chapter reminds us that everything in nature is linked, and we need to take care of it for ourselves and the future. It asks us to make good choices and protect the variety of life and the Earth’s materials that keep us alive. Learning about ecosystems helps us deal with environmental problems and live in harmony with nature.\n\n{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"nextItem\":[{\"position\":0,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Biotic Component: The living component of an ecosystem is the biotic component. Which includes biotic factors such as producers, consumers, decomposers, etc. It is divided into major groups:\"}}]}{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"nextItem\":[{\"position\":0,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Abiotic component: These are the nonliving components within an ecosystem such as light, temperature, water, soil, air, inorganic nutrients, etc.\"}}]}{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"nextItem\":[{\"position\":0,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Pyramid of numbers\"}},{\"position\":1,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Pyramid of energy\"}},{\"position\":2,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Pyramid of biomass\"}}]}{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"nextItem\":[{\"position\":0,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Structure and Function of Ecosystem\"}},{\"position\":1,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Decomposition\"}},{\"position\":2,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Energy Flow\"}},{\"position\":3,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Ecological Succession\"}},{\"position\":4,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Productivity\"}},{\"position\":5,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Ecological Pyramids\"}},{\"position\":6,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Nutrient Cycling\"}},{\"position\":7,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Ecosystem Services\"}}]}{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"nextItem\":[{\"position\":0,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"The NCERT Solutions for Biology Class 12 Chapter 12 (Ecosystem) facilitates a holistic understanding of the topics covered in the chapter.  \"}},{\"position\":1,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"By referring to the NCERT Solutions for Ecosystem you will be able to learn the appropriate answer pattern for the Class 12 Biology exam.\"}},{\"position\":2,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"The NCERT Solutions for Class 12 Chapter 12; Ecosystems, make an excellent resource for self-study and revision purposes. Therefore saving a lot of time during the exams.\"}},{\"position\":3,\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"item\":{\"name\":\"Since these solutions are available in a PDF format, you can consult them even when you are not connected to the internet.\"}}]}",
